sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant MediaMgmt
    participant EventBus
    participant VideoProcTask
    participant TranscriptionTask
    participant AnalysisTasks

    User->>+Frontend: Uploads a video file
    Frontend->>+API: POST /media
    API->>+MediaMgmt: CreateMediaCommand
    MediaMgmt->>+EventBus: publish(MediaUploaded)
    API-->>-Frontend: HTTP 202 Accepted (mediaId)
    Frontend-->>-User: Shows "Processing..." status

    Note over Frontend,AnalysisTasks: Polling for status updates happens in the background

    EventBus-->>+VideoProcTask: Consumes MediaUploaded
    VideoProcTask->>+EventBus: publish(AudioExtracted)
    
    EventBus-->>+TranscriptionTask: Consumes AudioExtracted
    TranscriptionTask->>+EventBus: publish(TextContentReady)

    EventBus-->>-AnalysisTasks: Consumes TextContentReady (triggers summarization, sentiment, topics in parallel)
    AnalysisTasks-->>AnalysisTasks: Processes and saves results
